Package: EMMLi
Type: Package
Title: A Maximum Likelihood Approach to the Analysis of Modularity
Version: 0.0.3
Date: 2017-02-17
Author: Anjali Goswami, Tim Lucas, Prabu Sivasubramaniam, John
        Finarelli
Maintainer: Tim Lucas <timcdlucas@gmail.com>
Description: Fit models of modularity to morphological landmarks.
        Perform model selection on results. Fit models with a single
        within-module correlation or with separate within-module
        correlations fitted to each module.
